{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00314","headline":"东亭茶宴 · 鲍氏君徽","name":"东亭茶宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲朝向晓出帘栊，茗宴东亭四望通。\n远眺城池山色里，俯聆弦管水声中。\n幽篁引沼新抽翠，芳槿低檐欲吐红。\n坐久此中无限兴，更怜团扇起清风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍氏君徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}